* What follows macro on its line is a comment (r68's macro takes no operand), with or without
* a star (TR macro * any comment); gas took it for a parameter list ("Bad parameter list for
* macro").
* fixed: dea50ca 2026-10-11 r68togas: a comment after macro
* expect text: 2ac04e71
TR	macro	* a comment of several words
	move.l	\1,(a5)+
	endm
T2 macro a comment without a star
 nop
 endm
 psect macro_comment,0,0,0,0,0
 TR d0
 T2
 ends
